<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Demo Session Closed</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 400px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .info-box {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            max-width: 400px;
        }

        .info-box h3 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .info-box p {
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon">🔒</div>
        <h1>Demo Session Closed</h1>
        <p>The security awareness demonstration has ended. Thank you for participating!</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <h3>What Did You Learn?</h3>
            <p>This demo showed how websites can request access to your camera, microphone, and location. Always be cautious before granting permissions to websites you don't trust!</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Check if demo becomes active again
        setInterval(async () => {
            try {
                const response = await fetch('/api/status');
                const result = await response.json();
                if (result.active) {
                    location.reload();
                }
            } catch (e) {}
        }, 5000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
